Subject: [PATCH] fix(stonedesk b33): anti-framing on stonedesk and
 stonedesk-hr, the LAYER 4 buster removed, and the Field Map image as an
 option

- Routed from fourth b43: the same hide-until-top-window block the 16 root apps carry, at the
  top of <head> in both files. LAYER 4 removed: Chrome blocks its top.location reassignment
  from a cross-origin frame, so the app stayed clickable (fourth measured it live).
- Field Map: the directions link always, the server-drawn image behind a "Show map image"
  toggle (Michael's call). 8 arms lift the shipped functions.
- stonedesk-hr.html declared in hank's assigned_overrides.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
