 docs/sairn-path-manifest.json |  4 ++-
 stonedesk-hr.html             | 11 ++++++
 stonedesk.html                | 67 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

